@gateway = http://localhost:5079

### 1. Health Check (Gateway)
GET {{gateway}}/health

### 2. Login as Demo User
# @name loginDemo
POST {{gateway}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@mymo.app",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

### 3. Get Current User Profile
@token = {{loginDemo.response.body.accessToken}}
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get Nearby Places (Map Service via Gateway)
GET {{gateway}}/api/places/nearby?latitude=10.7735&longitude=106.7034&radiusKm=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Filter Nearby Places by Vibe ("study")
GET {{gateway}}/api/places/nearby?latitude=10.7735&longitude=106.7034&radiusKm=10&vibe=study
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get Place Categories
GET {{gateway}}/api/place-categories

### 7. Get Social Public Feed
GET {{gateway}}/api/posts/feed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Chat with AI Assistant Hana
POST {{gateway}}/api/mymy/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Gợi ý quán cafe chill ở Quận 1"
}

### 9. Get B2C & B2B Product Packages Catalog (Business Service)
GET {{gateway}}/api/catalog/product-packages

